    {
      "id": "PalParkLobby_Text_WhatWasPokemonsName",
      "en_US": [
        "What was that Pokémon’s name now...?\n",
        "Oh, it’s on the tip of my tongue!"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Quel est le nom de ce Pokémon, déjà...?\n",
        "Ah, je l’ai sur le bout de la langue!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PalParkLobby_Text_AreYouTakingChallenge",
      "en_US": [
        "Pal Park is so scintillating!\r",
        "Trainers and Pokémon are so full of\n",
        "intensity here!\r",
        "Are you taking the challenge, too?"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Le Parc des Amis est vraiment féerique!\r",
        "Les Dresseurs et les Pokémon y sont\n",
        "pleins d’ardeur!\r",
        "Toi aussi, tu comptes relever le défi?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PalParkLobby_Text_WelcomeToPalPark_PlayerMale",
      "en_US": [
        "Welcome to Pal Park!\r",
        "This is where top-notch Trainers come\n",
        "to demonstrate their Pokémon-catching\f",
        "techniques to their peers.\r",
        "...Oh?\r",
        "Are you maybe...\n",
        "Ah, you are {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\r",
        "We’ve all heard rumors about you!\n",
        "Word is, you’re a hotshot Trainer?!\r",
        "We’d be honored if you would\n",
        "participate in our Catching Shows."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Bienvenue au Parc des Amis!\r",
        "C’est le lieu où les Dresseurs de\n",
        "haut niveau viennent montrer leurs\f",
        "techniques de capture à leurs pairs.\r",
        "... Oh?\r",
        "Vous ne seriez pas...\n",
        "Ah, vous êtes {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\r",
        "Il y a beaucoup de rumeurs sur vous!\n",
        "On vous tient pour un grand Dresseur?!\r",
        "Nous serions honorés de vous voir\n",
        "participer à un Show Capture."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PalParkLobby_Text_WelcomeToPalPark_PlayerFemale",
      "en_US": [
        "Welcome to Pal Park!\r",
        "This is where top-notch Trainers come\n",
        "to demonstrate their Pokémon-catching\f",
        "techniques to their peers.\r",
        "...Oh?\r",
        "Are you maybe...\n",
        "Ah, you are {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\r",
        "We’ve all heard rumors about you!\n",
        "Word is, you’re a hotshot Trainer?!\r",
        "We’d be honored if you would\n",
        "participate in our Catching Shows."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Bienvenue au Parc des Amis!\r",
        "C’est le lieu où les Dresseurs de\n",
        "haut niveau viennent montrer leurs\f",
        "techniques de capture à leurs pairs.\r",
        "... Oh?\r",
        "Vous ne seriez pas...\n",
        "Ah, vous êtes {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\r",
        "Il y a beaucoup de rumeurs sur vous!\n",
        "On vous tient pour un grand Dresseur?!\r",
        "Nous serions honorés de vous voir\n",
        "participer à un Show Capture."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PalParkLobby_Text_LetMeExplainPalPark",
      "en_US": [
        "Yes! You agreed to participate!\n",
        "It’s a happy day for me!\r",
        "Let’s not waste any time!\n",
        "Let me explain how Pal Park works.\r",
        "I wrote the Pal Park manual for\n",
        "situations just like this.\r",
        "What should I explain?"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Oui! Vous acceptez de participer!\n",
        "C’est un grand jour pour moi!\r",
        "Ne perdons pas de temps! Je vais vous\n",
        "présenter le Parc des Amis.\r",
        "C’est pour ce type d’occasions que j’ai\n",
        "écrit le manuel du Parc des Amis.\r",
        "Que voudriez-vous savoir?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PalParkLobby_Text_Manual_BasicRules",
      "en_US": [
        "Pal Park is a place where you are\n",
        "timed on the catching of six Pokémon.\r",
        "You are provided with six special\n",
        "Poké Balls for the challenge.\r",
        "Participating Trainers are required to\n",
        "supply the six Pokémon that are to\f",
        "be caught.\r",
        "If you do not supply the stock of six\n",
        "Pokémon, you may not participate in\f",
        "the Catching Show.\r",
        "...Do you want me to explain anything\n",
        "else?"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Le Parc des Amis vous propose \n",
        "d’attraper six Pokémon en temps limité.\r",
        "Pour ce faire, on vous fournit\n",
        "six Poké Balls spéciales.\r",
        "Les Dresseurs qui participent doivent\n",
        "fournir les six Pokémon à capturer.\r",
        "Vous ne pouvez pas participer\n",
        "au Show Capture si vous ne\f",
        "fournissez pas les six Pokémon.\r",
        "... Voulez-vous de plus\n",
        "amples explications?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PalParkLobby_Text_Manual_CatchingShow",
      "en_US": [
        "At the start of the Catching Show,\n",
        "you will be given six Park Balls.\r",
        "Use the Park Balls to catch the\n",
        "six Pokémon you provide.\r",
        "...Do you want me to explain anything\n",
        "else?"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "On vous fournit six Parc Balls au début\n",
        "du Show Capture.\r",
        "Utilisez-les pour attraper les six\n",
        "Pokémon fournis.\r",
        "... Voulez-vous de plus\n",
        "amples explications?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PalParkLobby_Text_Manual_StockingPokemon",
      "en_US": [
        "You may make Pokémon migrate from\n",
        "Kanto or Hoenn. Doing so will stock\f",
        "your Catching Game.\r",
        "Insert a Game Boy Advance Pokémon\n",
        "Ruby, Sapphire, Emerald, FireRed,\f",
        "or LeafGreen in the Game Pak slot.\r",
        "When your DS is turned on, currently\n",
        "caught Pokémon can migrate from\f",
        "the Game Pak to the DS Game Card.\r",
        "...Do you want me to explain anything\n",
        "else?"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Vous devez faire migrer des Pokémon\n",
        "de Kanto ou de Hoenn pour\f",
        "participer au Show Capture.\r",
        "Insérez une cartouche de jeu\n",
        "Game Boy Advance Pokémon\r",
        "Rubis, Saphir, Emeraude, Rouge Feu\n",
        "ou Vert Feuille dans le port cartouche.\r",
        "Lorsque la DS est allumée, les Pokémon\n",
        "actuellement capturés peuvent migrer\f",
        "du port cartouche vers la carte DS.\r",
        "... Voulez-vous que j’explique autre \n",
        "chose?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PalParkLobby_Text_Manual_Stocking2_Unused",
      "en_US": [
        "Pokémon caught in Sinnoh may also\n",
        "be used to stock your Catching Game.\r",
        "Please ask the guy next to me who’s\n",
        "in charge of stocking Pokémon.\r",
        "...Do you want me to explain anything\n",
        "else?"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Les Pokémon de Sinnoh peuvent aussi\n",
        "servir pour le Show Capture.\r",
        "Veuillez vous adresser à l’homme à côté\n",
        "de moi, il est responsable des stocks.\r",
        "... Voulez-vous que j’explique autre\n",
        "chose?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PalParkLobby_Text_TakePartInCatchingShow",
      "en_US": [
        "Would you like to take part in\n",
        "a Catching Show now?"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Voulez-vous participer \n",
        "au Show Capture?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "PalParkLobby_Text_AwwThatsTooBad",
      "en_US": [
        "Aww, that’s too bad.\r",
